  "notes": [
    "Independent visual measurement from original PNG frames; only manifest.json and config.json supplied metadata were read. No other reviewer labels, draft times, audits, or examples were consulted.",
    "Coordinates refer to the visible rounded hull nose boundary at the advancing bow, excluding flag, driver and spray. Coordinates are visual pixel estimates, with several-pixel uncertainty from blur.",
